==Czech==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|sla-pro|cs}} {{term/t|sla-pro|*mysliti}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|cs}} {{term/t|ine-pro|*muHdʰ-}}.

===Pronunciation===
*{{IPA|/mɪslɛt/|lang=cs}}
*{{audio|Cs-myslet.ogg|audio|lang=cs}}

===Verb===
{{cs-verb|a=i}}

# to [[think]] {{gloss|to reckon, to estimate}}
#: '''''Myslím''', že to zvládneš.'' — I think you're going to make it.
# to [[think]] {{gloss|to think about}}
#: ''Musel jsem na ni '''myslet''' celý den.'' — I had to think about her all day long.

